Package: openwhisper
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Fiori Labs <support@fiorilabs.tech>
Homepage: https://openwhisper.fiorilabs.tech
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC_MIN@), libdrm2, libegl1, libgl1, libportaudio2, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xkb1, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Recommends: gnome-keyring, pulseaudio-utils
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Private, local-first speech-to-text desktop application
 OpenWhisper records microphone audio and transcribes it with local Whisper
 models or configured cloud APIs. It includes global hotkeys, auto-paste,
 transcription history, and a PyQt6 desktop interface.
